WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:01.835
Basketball.

00:00:03.044 --> 00:00:04.421
Since I was a kid,

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:06.131
I fell in love with this game.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.929
And when I’m gliding through the air,

00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:16.516
it’s like pressing mute on everything else.

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:22.355
Jace Carson has arrived.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.190
New season! New level!

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:25.483
Get yo butt to school.

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:27.152
Love you, Momma.

00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:31.865
Given all of your options,

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:33.408
you have to decide.

00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:34.993
Do you want to be good at the next level

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:36.327
or do you want to be great?

00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:40.707
At Cedar Cove Prep,

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.126
I expect you to be acutely mindful

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:44.252
and acutely prepared.

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:47.255
Not just on the hardwood, Mr. Carson.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:48.089
Understood?

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.174
Understood.

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:53.261
Jace has got too much riding on his senior year.

00:00:53.261 --> 00:00:55.930
We need to know he’s with someone who’ll watch his back.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:58.767
You did say if I ever needed anything…

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:00.727
Swagger Prep on three!

00:01:00.977 --> 00:01:01.770
One, two, three!

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:02.562
Swagger!

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.067
Something horrible stopped because

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.485
my best friend stepped up

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:09.861
and did something about it.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:12.405
Unfortunately I don’t think it’ll be likely

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:13.573
that things will work out for him.

00:01:15.867 --> 00:01:17.118
All the work you’ve done.

00:01:17.118 --> 00:01:19.329
You’re so close and you put it all at risk!

00:01:19.329 --> 00:01:20.038
I had to.

00:01:20.371 --> 00:01:21.623
You could go to jail!

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:24.751
Jace, who else was with you that night?

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:25.376
Let’s go! Let’s go!

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:27.545
He attacked a man with the help of three others.

00:01:27.545 --> 00:01:29.089
Everyone is watching.

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:31.049
Now is the time to stand with the kids.

00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:33.760
Our school’s reputation is at stake!

00:01:36.846 --> 00:01:37.972
I feel like I’m drowning.

00:01:37.972 --> 00:01:39.974
Don’t let other people’s opinion…

00:01:40.517 --> 00:01:41.392
Become my reality.

00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:41.726
Come on!

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:51.111
The world ain't ready for what’s about to happen.

00:01:53.196 --> 00:01:55.031
Not even close.

